      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "the Schwarzwald Republic,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "in located in northwestern"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Lighthalzen. You can't miss"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "the headquarters building."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Lighthalzen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "The Train Station is"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "located in the center of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "the city, where we have"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "a direct railroad to Einbroch."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Lighthalzen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Our Police Station is just"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "north of the city's center."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Please don't hesitate to report"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "any suspicious persons and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "activity, or if you have any"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "problems whatsoever."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Lighthalzen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "The Bank is located"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "just opposite to the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Lighthalzen Police Station,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "which is a pretty good idea"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "when I think about it, actually. ^FFFFFFspacer^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Lighthalzen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Our Hotel is located in"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "the middle of the South Plaza."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Due to its quality services and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "luxurious accomodations, this"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "hotel is extremely popular."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Lighthalzen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "The Airport is to the far"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "west of the Central Promenade."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "You can travel anywhere within"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "the Schwarzwald Republic by"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "riding on one of the Airships."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Lighthalzen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "The Merchant Guild can be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "found in the southwestern"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "part of Lighthalzen."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Lighthalzen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "The Jewelry Shop is"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "located just west of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "the South Plaza."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Lighthalzen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "The Weapon Shop is"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "located at the end of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "the Central Promenade."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "It's at least worth a look"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "if you're serious about"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "adventuring around here."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Lighthalzen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "The Department Store is"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "located in the middle of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Lighthalzen and is the biggest"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "and most convenient place for"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "shopping for almost everything."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Lighthalzen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Please ask me to ''Remove"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Marks from Mini-Map'' if you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "no longer wish to have the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "location marks displayed"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "on your Mini-Map."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Lighthalzen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Advances in sorcery and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "technology have allowed"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "us to update our information"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "system, enabling up to mark"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 182,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "locations on your Mini-Map"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 183,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "for easier navigation."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 185,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Lighthalzen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Your Mini-Map is located"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "in the upper right corner"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 188,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "of the screen. If you can't"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 189,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "see it, press the Ctrl + Tab"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 190,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "keys or click the ''Map'' button in your Basic Info Window."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Lighthalzen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "On your Mini-Map,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 194,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "click on the ''+'' and ''-''"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "symbols to zoom in and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "our of your Mini-Map. We"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 197,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "hope you enjoy your travels"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 198,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "here in Lighthalzen."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 201,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Lighthalzen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 202,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Lighthalzen is divided"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 203,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "into the East and West"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 204,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "districts by a railroad that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 205,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "runs right through the middle."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 206,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "There are always guards on"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 207,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "watch to protect the peace."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 209,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "[Lighthalzen Guide]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 210,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "Please don't hesitate"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 211,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "to report any suspicious"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 212,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "activity or persons to us."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 213,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "We hope that you enjoy"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 214,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "text" : "our fair city, adventurer."
    }
  ]
}